flowchart TD
  accTitle: Google Play commit handling after merges 145 and 144
  accDescr: PR 145 records Alpha commit responses and reports HTTP status with a structured Play error when available. PR 144 does the same for Internal commits and sends changesNotSentForReview=true to avoid disrupting an active Alpha review.

  alpha[PR 145: Alpha promotion commit] --> alphaRequest[Commit uses changesInReviewBehavior]
  alpha --> alphaResponse[Save response and capture HTTP status]
  alphaResponse --> alphaFailure[Non-2xx: report Alpha rejection and structured error when available]
  alphaFailure --> alphaValidation[Validator and negative regression test]

  internal[PR 144: Internal deployment commit] --> internalRequest[Commit uses changesNotSentForReview=true]
  internal --> internalResponse[Save response and capture HTTP status]
  internalResponse --> internalFailure[Non-2xx: report Internal rejection and structured error when available]
  internalFailure --> internalValidation[Tagged-release validator and negative regression test]
